Z||000011||Monkeyman||04-26-2000||10:22 AM||||Old Lar--I have the figures correct.  I have a <B>very</B> understanding wife.  Closing at 3pm tomorrow.  (They keep changing it.  Must be a woman in charge. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Putting on my nomex!)  I plan on being asleep through most of it.  (73 hours so far this week, a double tonight, 12 hours tomorrow and another 10 1/2 on Friday!)  All that time at work for $5.50/hr. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  If they don't promote me to manager soon, I'll be tempted to get medieval on their a**! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
