Z||000021||Monkeyman||05-02-2000||12:02 PM||||I used to work for a guy who only bought cheap, worn out cars.  He <B>never</B> fixed anything.  He wouldn't even replace the tires.  If something wore out that he couldn't live with he just bought another beater and sold the old one.  Kind of a waste of $$ if you ask me.  He sold me a '78 TA for $500 (what he paid for it).  All it needed was a couple headlights and 2 new tires.  The body was in decent shape and the interior was like new.  I put about $1000 in it, drove it for a couple of years, and sold it for $3000. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
